title: "doudizhu-dmc-lab: 斗地主 DMC 实验台 (DouDizhu Deep Monte Carlo brain lab)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gao
    given-names: Shuyao
    email: "gaoshuyao.mk@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "aSSIST University (Seoul School of Integrated Sciences and Technologies)"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/doudizhu-dmc-lab"
url: "https://ShuyaoGao.github.io/doudizhu-dmc-lab/play/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): three small Q-networks, trained with
  Deep Monte Carlo self-play in the spirit of DouZero, play DouDizhu while a live "brain panel"
  shows the real activations, attributions and Q values of every legal move, computed in
  JavaScript from the exported weights. Includes watch / play / practice modes, neuron
  knock-out, and the full PyTorch training and evaluation code.
keywords:
  - course-demo
  - reinforcement-learning
  - doudizhu
  - deep-monte-carlo
